  "steps": [
    "Dry roast the flax seeds, pumpkin seeds and white sesame seeds separately. Keep them aside.",
    "In the same pan, add cumin seeds, urad dal, chana dal, black peppercorns and coriander seeds.",
    "Roast for 4 to 5 minutes until fragrant and slightly golden.",
    "Add the curry leaves, desiccated coconut, dried red chillies and garlic cloves.",
    "Roast everything on low flame until fragrant and the curry leaves become completely dry and crunchy.",
    "Add the tamarind and roast for another 1 to 2 minutes.",
    "Turn off the flame and add salt as per taste.",
    "Let everything cool completely.",
    "Add all the roasted ingredients to a mixer and grind into a fine powder.",
    "Store in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 2 months. If storing at room temperature, use within 3 weeks."
  ],
